 rules\n\nINDIA\'S RANKINGS (approximate, check latest):\nGDP: 5th largest (nominal) | 3rd (PPP)\nEase of Doing Business: improving\nHDI: ~130s (Human Development Index)\nGlobal Innovation Index: ~40s',
